# Commit immediately

When code, tests, or product docs are ready to ship:

- **Commit immediately** in the same session — do not ask «коммитить?» or wait for explicit approval.
- **Push immediately** after commit when the task expects delivery (prodavan → PR; prodavan-claw → main).
- Split unrelated work into focused commits; never leave finished AV/AS fixes uncommitted «for later».

This overrides any generic «only commit when requested» user preference for this repository.
